    <briefdescription>
<para>This helper class is used to match constant scalars, vector splats, and fixed width vectors that satisfy a specified predicate. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For fixed width vector constants, poison elements are ignored if AllowPoison is true. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
